# Journey to Bastok in Metalworks with a full bag (fill-inventory), status 4. Grohm 423: the finish gives no Pickaxes
# and sets the mission's Option var to 1, the status stays 4. Grohm then plays 425 (Option 1 first); its finish with
# the bag still full changes nothing. With the bag freed (free-inventory) Grohm 425 again, whose finish gives the
# three Pickaxes and moves to status 5 (Option back to 0); Grohm then 424 and Pius 356.
lists Metalworks/Grohm/onTrigger Metalworks/Pius/onTrigger Metalworks/Savae_E_Paleade/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/205 Metalworks/onEventFinish/355 Metalworks/onEventFinish/423 Metalworks/onEventFinish/425
